{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_042","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"Test Case preparation status: It gives Test Case preparation progress against planned","location_hint":"paragraph 229","char_start":6368,"char_end":6453,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_043","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"Weekly Test Progress- Provides week-wise details of percentage test completion- Failed, not executed & executed against planned for execution tests.","location_hint":"paragraph 230","char_start":6455,"char_end":6603,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_044","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"Defects Status & Details- It gives Percentage of open & closed defects by the week. Also, week-wise defects distribution based on severity and priority","location_hint":"paragraph 231","char_start":6605,"char_end":6756,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_045","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"Environment Availability &#8211; Total number of hours &#8220;up&#8221; / Total number of hours scheduled per day for testing","location_hint":"paragraph 232","char_start":6758,"char_end":6883,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_046","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"End to End Testing Vs System Testing","location_hint":"paragraph 233","char_start":6887,"char_end":6923,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_047","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"End to End Testing\nSystem Testing","location_hint":"paragraph 234","char_start":6927,"char_end":6960,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_048","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"Validates the software system as well as interconnected sub-systems\nValidates just the software system as per the requirements specifications.","location_hint":"paragraph 235","char_start":6965,"char_end":7107,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_049","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"It checks the complete end-to-end process flow.\nIt checks system functionalities and features.","location_hint":"paragraph 236","char_start":7109,"char_end":7203,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_050","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"All interfaces, backend systems will be considered for testing\nFunctional and Non-Functional Testing will be considered for testing","location_hint":"paragraph 237","char_start":7205,"char_end":7336,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_051","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"It&#8217;s executed once System Testing is completed.\nIt&#8217;s executed after Integration Testing .","location_hint":"paragraph 238","char_start":7338,"char_end":7439,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_052","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"End to End testing involves checking external interfaces which can be complex to automate. Hence Manual Testing is preferred.\nBoth Manual and Automation can be performed for System Testing","location_hint":"paragraph 239","char_start":7441,"char_end":7629,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_53ee6a9ec24b_053","source_id":"src_53ee6a9ec24b","source_hash":"bc7768df40b7befc5b887d69186521da80c7a2a77c5da28e008bac6883601f28","text":"In software engineering, end-to-end testing in software testing is the process of verifying a software system along with its sub-systems. The biggest challenge in this testing is to have enough knowledge of the whole system as well as an interconnected sub-system.","location_hint":"paragraph 241","char_start":7645,"char_end":7909,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T18:47:35.201Z"}
